{"4083230": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Children´s Fear", "steam_appid": 4083230, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Children's Fear is a turn-based RPG with horror elements where you will meet Zala, Luka, and Darko.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After their father lost his job, the three siblings moved to Paura Valley.  They must be careful, because not everything is as it seems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Paura Valley</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the village, you will meet different people, some willing to help you, others not so much. And if you look closely, you will see the truth that is hidden in plain sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083230/extras/fef8782c9b055b9aed656e2ad2d5882e.poster.avif?t=1768283329\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083230/extras/fef8782c9b055b9aed656e2ad2d5882e.webm?t=1768283329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083230/extras/b2932e63d0d59a060f43a018cdfcf023.poster.avif?t=1768283329\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083230/extras/b2932e63d0d59a060f43a018cdfcf023.webm?t=1768283329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083230/extras/b2932e63d0d59a060f43a018cdfcf023.mp4?t=1768283329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face your fears</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to plan your strategy carefully if you want to survive the dangers that lurk in the darkness. Always look out for your siblings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083230/extras/8e7cee45a6b8d2b8b390b28c9bcfba7a.poster.avif?t=1768283329\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083230/extras/8e7cee45a6b8d2b8b390b28c9bcfba7a.webm?t=1768283329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083230/extras/8e7cee45a6b8d2b8b390b28c9bcfba7a.mp4?t=1768283329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>If you stare too long into the darkness...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your step, watch your back, and keep your eyes open to the truth. Various creatures lurk in Paura Valley, and as you venture into its corners, you will learn its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083230/extras/30f601cbbfd279996e4f28d424ca9423.poster.avif?t=1768283329\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083230/extras/30f601cbbfd279996e4f28d424ca9423.webm?t=1768283329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083230/extras/30f601cbbfd279996e4f28d424ca9423.mp4?t=1768283329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Children's Fear is a turn-based RPG with horror elements where you will meet Zala, Luka, and Darko.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After their father lost his job, the three siblings moved to Paura Valley.  They must be careful, because not everything is as it seems.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Paura Valley</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the village, you will meet different people, some willing to help you, others not so much. And if you look closely, you will see the truth that is hidden in plain sight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083230/extras/fef8782c9b055b9aed656e2ad2d5882e.poster.avif?t=1768283329\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083230/extras/fef8782c9b055b9aed656e2ad2d5882e.webm?t=1768283329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083230/extras/b2932e63d0d59a060f43a018cdfcf023.poster.avif?t=1768283329\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083230/extras/b2932e63d0d59a060f43a018cdfcf023.webm?t=1768283329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083230/extras/b2932e63d0d59a060f43a018cdfcf023.mp4?t=1768283329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Face your fears</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need to plan your strategy carefully if you want to survive the dangers that lurk in the darkness. Always look out for your siblings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083230/extras/8e7cee45a6b8d2b8b390b28c9bcfba7a.poster.avif?t=1768283329\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083230/extras/8e7cee45a6b8d2b8b390b28c9bcfba7a.webm?t=1768283329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083230/extras/8e7cee45a6b8d2b8b390b28c9bcfba7a.mp4?t=1768283329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>If you stare too long into the darkness...</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch your step, watch your back, and keep your eyes open to the truth. Various creatures lurk in Paura Valley, and as you venture into its corners, you will learn its secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083230/extras/30f601cbbfd279996e4f28d424ca9423.poster.avif?t=1768283329\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083230/extras/30f601cbbfd279996e4f28d424ca9423.webm?t=1768283329\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4083230/extras/30f601cbbfd279996e4f28d424ca9423.mp4?t=1768283329\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Children's Fear is a turn-based RPG with horror elements where you will meet Zala, Luka, and Darko. After a series of events, they find themselves trapped in a journey where they must eliminate the darkness that stalks them in order to regain the life they had before arriving in the Paura Valley.", "supported_languages": "Spanish - Latin America, English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_asse